WEBVTT

00:17.950 --> 00:20.060
<i>Goblins can be dangerous in groups,</i>

00:20.060 --> 00:23.150
<i>but I can use the layout of the dungeon 
to force them into one-on-one fights,</i>

00:23.150 --> 00:24.290
<i>where they're helpless against me.</i>

00:28.480 --> 00:31.670
<i>I existential evolved into a ghoul, 
and I've got some muscle now.</i>

00:31.670 --> 00:34.430
<i>I'm much more agile than 
I was as a skeleton.</i>

00:34.890 --> 00:38.290
<i>And the biggest surprise was 
that my mana, spirit energy,</i>

00:38.290 --> 00:40.120
<i>and divinity have all increased.</i>

00:40.380 --> 00:45.830
<i>Now I can strengthen not 
only myself, but my sword.</i>

00:56.540 --> 01:00.930
<i>Maybe... I'm even stronger 
now than I was as a human!</i>

02:38.670 --> 02:42.970
The Rookie and
 the Veteran

03:03.950 --> 03:06.270
<i>It's been so long since I've seen a human.</i>

03:07.190 --> 03:10.550
<i>No, I can't go out there like this.</i>

03:11.100 --> 03:14.730
<i>I'm a ghoul. She'd either 
try to kill me or run away.</i>

03:15.430 --> 03:18.010
<i>So I'll just watch from a distance.</i>

03:20.700 --> 03:22.790
<i>I'm so jealous she gets to be human.</i>

03:23.540 --> 03:26.540
<i>I don't recognize her. Is she a rookie?</i>

03:27.380 --> 03:31.590
<i>I know pretty much every 
adventurer in Maalt, actually.</i>

03:31.590 --> 03:35.570
<i>The reason I know them is because 
adventurers can be a rough crowd,</i>

03:35.570 --> 03:38.160
<i>and a lot of them will make 
fun of weaklings like me,</i>

03:38.160 --> 03:41.190
<i>or try to get us to take the 
fall for something they did.</i>

03:41.660 --> 03:46.420
<i>Knowing their abilities and who 
their friends are can help a lot.</i>

03:46.950 --> 03:52.060
<i>Having fewer bad guys around made the 
adventurers in Maalt a lot better than most.</i>

03:52.590 --> 03:55.860
<i>And the guild seems to like having me around.</i>

03:55.860 --> 03:59.050
<i>As weak as I am, hasn't 
told me I need to retire.</i>

04:10.220 --> 04:11.490
<i>That way leads to...</i>

04:26.940 --> 04:29.000
<i>She's received proper training.</i>

04:30.660 --> 04:33.470
<i>But she's weak, so she needs 
to land a lot of hits.</i>

04:33.470 --> 04:36.230
<i>She's probably planning on taking her 
time and dodging while she defeats it...</i>

04:38.500 --> 04:40.550
<i>But she's not watching 
her surroundings at all.</i>

04:45.300 --> 04:49.470
I'm going to become a real adventurer!

04:50.270 --> 04:53.200
I won't let a skeleton beat me!

05:02.200 --> 05:03.570
<i>I guess I've got no choice.</i>

05:08.280 --> 05:09.250
A ghoul?!

05:11.900 --> 05:16.500
<i>Come on... The enemy just turned 
its back to you! Attack it!</i>

05:16.810 --> 05:19.400
<i>No, I guess she's too stunned 
to think about that.</i>

05:27.950 --> 05:29.260
Wow.

05:30.170 --> 05:32.470
Um...

05:32.990 --> 05:35.620
I'm glad you're safe...

05:37.060 --> 05:43.880
H-Hello... I'm R-Rentt...

05:43.880 --> 05:45.650
Rentt!

05:46.200 --> 05:48.360
Stay away from me!

05:48.360 --> 05:51.720
Please! Listen to me!

05:51.720 --> 05:54.840
I'm not your enemy...

05:57.090 --> 05:58.780
P-Please...

05:59.250 --> 06:01.770
It's... talking?

06:01.770 --> 06:03.730
Y-Yes!

06:03.730 --> 06:05.840
I'm Rentt...

06:06.290 --> 06:08.190
An adventurer...

06:08.480 --> 06:11.370
An adventurer? An adventurer!

06:11.370 --> 06:12.790
Yes!

06:12.790 --> 06:15.390
I'm an adventurer!

06:15.390 --> 06:17.720
My name is Rentt!

06:18.160 --> 06:20.410
Rendo?

06:20.410 --> 06:23.610
Renro... Rentt!

06:23.610 --> 06:25.500
Rentt!

06:25.500 --> 06:26.480
Yes!

06:27.520 --> 06:33.030
So, why do you look like that, Rentt?

06:33.030 --> 06:34.340
Some kind of disguise?

06:34.340 --> 06:38.170
N-No! I died...

06:38.170 --> 06:41.470
But... I'm alive!

06:42.000 --> 06:46.330
Yes, you don't look like a normal monster.

06:46.330 --> 06:48.810
Thank you for saving me.

06:49.300 --> 06:53.760
Adventurers... look out for each other...

06:54.400 --> 06:56.850
Um... I appreciate you saying that.

06:56.850 --> 07:00.530
So... I hate to ask, but...

07:00.530 --> 07:02.100
What?

07:02.100 --> 07:05.100
Can I go back?

07:05.100 --> 07:07.200
You're not going to kill me, right?

07:07.410 --> 07:10.700
I-I'm not going to kill you...

07:10.700 --> 07:14.000
But I want your help...

07:14.420 --> 07:15.410
Help?

07:15.410 --> 07:19.610
I want you... to buy me clothes.

07:20.130 --> 07:21.830
Clothes?

07:22.270 --> 07:25.540
I want to go back to Maalt.

07:25.810 --> 07:30.740
Oh... so perhaps a robe 
that would hide your body?

07:30.740 --> 07:32.770
Thank you...

07:32.770 --> 07:35.050
M-Money...

07:36.730 --> 07:42.550
If you... buy me those clothes... 
you can have the rest.

07:47.920 --> 07:49.470
Please...

07:52.640 --> 07:54.270
My name is Rina Rupaage.

07:54.270 --> 07:57.160
As the daughter of a knight, 
I shall repay this debt.

08:04.740 --> 08:07.210
Just wait for me, Rentt...

08:10.580 --> 08:12.920
<i>She's pretty cautious around me.</i>

08:12.920 --> 08:15.630
<i>For an adventurer, that's 
the right way to be, but...</i>

08:16.030 --> 08:18.750
<i>A proper adventurer would report</i>

08:18.750 --> 08:23.400
<i>something as strange as a ghoul 
like me to the guild immediately.</i>

08:23.980 --> 08:27.080
<i>But I don't think she'll betray me.</i>

08:27.690 --> 08:33.120
<i>Even if I'm wrong, though, I'll cross 
that bridge when I come to it.</i>

08:40.210 --> 08:41.850
Excuse me!

08:42.800 --> 08:44.130
Aren't you...?

08:47.510 --> 08:50.830
You don't look hurt. I'm glad.

08:50.830 --> 08:55.100
I was worried because you didn't 
come back after sunset.

08:55.100 --> 08:57.860
Well, a lot happened.

08:58.410 --> 09:02.150
There's something I want 
to ask you, actually...

09:08.420 --> 09:13.030
<i>I can't believe it... but I'm a lot 
stronger than I was as a human.</i>

09:13.620 --> 09:15.520
<i>It's not just that I'm stronger.</i>

09:15.520 --> 09:18.650
<i>My body moves exactly how I want it to!</i>

09:22.910 --> 09:25.260
<i>And I think my vision's better, too...</i>

09:25.260 --> 09:28.960
<i>No, this is probably just what 
they call combat intuition.</i>

09:29.310 --> 09:31.990
<i>Something you can't learn 
from training or studying.</i>

09:31.990 --> 09:35.970
<i>So this is how the world looked to all 
the adventurers that succeeded...</i>

09:36.610 --> 09:40.790
<i>To think I only got the power I wanted 
most after I ended up in this body...</i>

09:41.720 --> 09:43.690
Rentt?

09:43.690 --> 09:46.500
Rentt, where are you?

09:50.620 --> 09:52.760
Rentt?

09:53.790 --> 09:57.320
S-She really came back...

09:57.320 --> 09:59.160
Rentt!

10:02.160 --> 10:06.420
Um... you're Rentt, right?

10:06.420 --> 10:09.470
Or are you another ghoul, perhaps?

10:09.470 --> 10:10.950
I'm Rentt.

10:11.430 --> 10:16.610
Ghouls don't show up on the 
early levels like this.

10:16.610 --> 10:18.500
I see...

10:19.550 --> 10:22.760
I feel like you've gotten a 
little better at talking.

10:23.230 --> 10:25.960
I-I practiced...

10:26.290 --> 10:28.930
G-Great idea!

10:28.930 --> 10:33.280
Oh, right. This is what you 
asked for and your change.

10:40.320 --> 10:45.500
S-Sorry... I'm still a little scared.

10:45.850 --> 10:49.550
Give me a little more time... Just a 
little more time until I get used to you!

10:49.550 --> 10:52.830
No, it's fine...

10:53.170 --> 10:56.760
Now, may I look at the clothes?

10:56.760 --> 10:59.140
Of course! Go ahead!

11:05.830 --> 11:07.610
Wow.

11:07.610 --> 11:09.640
Do you like them?

11:09.640 --> 11:11.090
Yes.

11:11.470 --> 11:14.310
<i>A plain color that nobody 
would give a second glance,</i>

11:14.310 --> 11:18.320
<i>and a robe that conceals the whole body, 
like a mage would wear! Wonderful!</i>

11:19.700 --> 11:21.660
It's perfect!

11:22.520 --> 11:25.500
I brought other things I 
thought you might need.

11:25.500 --> 11:31.250
I just got to Maalt, so I had someone 
in the guild show me the best shops.

11:35.530 --> 11:39.300
It felt like a bad idea to let 
anyone see your arms or legs...

11:40.940 --> 11:44.230
<i>What a kind, considerate girl!</i>

11:45.940 --> 11:49.420
<i>I feel like I could cry! 
Except I physically can't!</i>

11:49.420 --> 11:50.830
Rentt?

11:50.830 --> 11:53.290
No, it's nothing...

11:53.290 --> 11:55.260
I'll try them on right away.

12:01.490 --> 12:03.460
<i>It's easier to move in this than I thought.</i>

12:04.050 --> 12:08.530
<i>I lose some visibility, but it would be 
easy enough to fight a monster or two...</i>

12:08.870 --> 12:10.020
How do you like them?

12:10.320 --> 12:11.990
They're perfect.

12:11.990 --> 12:13.590
Great!

12:13.590 --> 12:18.590
You look pretty imposing, 
too. Almost like a wight!

12:21.290 --> 12:24.170
I stand out too much...

12:25.350 --> 12:26.970
I guess that won't work.

12:26.970 --> 12:31.100
Um, how about this?

12:31.390 --> 12:33.360
What's this?

12:33.670 --> 12:38.610
I thought it might be a bad idea for you to try to
go into town with your face looking like that.

12:39.220 --> 12:41.590
Thank you...

12:50.210 --> 12:55.370
When I first saw you, I thought 
you were a rare or named monster.

12:55.690 --> 13:01.580
A special type of monster, 
huh? You may be right.

13:08.140 --> 13:09.790
You look great!

13:13.510 --> 13:15.500
I can't get it off.

13:23.280 --> 13:24.880
No luck...

13:24.880 --> 13:26.070
I'm sorry.

13:26.430 --> 13:30.050
I saw it at a market stall and 
couldn't stop thinking about it...

13:30.050 --> 13:33.030
But looking back, it did 
seem a little suspicious.

13:33.030 --> 13:37.460
A market stall? Not a place 
introduced by the guild?

13:37.460 --> 13:40.760
It wasn't. The mask was the one thing 
I bought at that market stall.

13:40.760 --> 13:43.610
It was shockingly cheap.

13:43.610 --> 13:45.070
How much?

13:45.070 --> 13:46.810
Three coppers.

13:47.440 --> 13:49.890
That's three loaves of bread.

13:50.490 --> 13:53.210
Yeah, that's just too cheap.

13:53.640 --> 14:00.060
I did check for curses! And nothing 
happened when I touched it...

14:00.310 --> 14:03.300
<i>A curse that activates 
when you put it on, huh?</i>

14:03.300 --> 14:05.780
<i>I really do have the worst luck...</i>

14:06.480 --> 14:08.470
Let me try this out.

14:10.560 --> 14:12.530
You can use divinity?!

14:12.780 --> 14:15.670
Just a little...

14:15.990 --> 14:21.060
<i>Now that I have more divinity, I might 
be able to break a basic curse.</i>

14:25.970 --> 14:28.400
I'm out of energy...

14:29.040 --> 14:30.680
No luck?

14:30.680 --> 14:34.560
I'm so sorry for bringing you a cursed item!

14:34.560 --> 14:36.450
It's fine!

14:36.450 --> 14:38.830
But it's all my fault!

14:39.490 --> 14:44.650
Right now, I need to
hide my face anyway...

14:44.650 --> 14:47.840
It responded to the divinity.

14:47.840 --> 14:53.440
I just need to save up money and ask 
a powerful cleric to break the curse.

14:53.750 --> 14:56.410
So don't worry about it...

14:58.020 --> 14:59.670
I'm sorry.

15:02.520 --> 15:04.510
What...?

15:05.040 --> 15:07.600
I can tell...

15:08.060 --> 15:11.160
you're not a bad person.

15:11.570 --> 15:14.880
So I'm not scared anymore!

15:15.790 --> 15:18.430
I'm... not scared.

15:22.780 --> 15:24.390
Thank you.

15:25.230 --> 15:32.320
But you don't have to force yourself... 
until the day when you really are used to me.

15:32.320 --> 15:35.530
It won't take long at all! 
It won't! I'm sure of it!

15:38.240 --> 15:41.680
Now Rentt, let's head back to Maalt.

15:48.770 --> 15:52.500
I registered as an adventurer 
in the capital city guild.

15:52.500 --> 15:56.210
But there are a lot of famous 
adventurers there...

15:56.210 --> 15:59.580
Since there weren't any 
jobs for rookies like me,

15:59.580 --> 16:01.400
they recommended I come to Maalt.

16:01.400 --> 16:03.800
There are two labyrinths 
close by, for one thing.

16:03.800 --> 16:05.890
A good choice.

16:06.410 --> 16:10.400
But I'm surprised you were willing to 
come all the way out to the countryside.

16:10.970 --> 16:14.590
I wanted to see the outside 
world, and more than anything,

16:14.590 --> 16:17.910
I want to get stronger and become 
a full-fledged adventurer fast!

16:18.110 --> 16:24.870
I understand how you feel. But it's better 
for an adventurer to be a coward.

16:25.310 --> 16:28.080
You've only got one life.

16:31.070 --> 16:32.040
Yes!

16:32.340 --> 16:35.750
Guys like me are pretty rare.

16:53.980 --> 16:55.550
What's wrong?

16:55.550 --> 16:58.860
A lot of people here know me.

16:58.860 --> 17:02.330
They'll know something's 
wrong if I show my ID.

17:02.880 --> 17:05.580
Then shall we go in from a different gate?

17:05.580 --> 17:10.020
Yes. One that's not normally used.

17:10.020 --> 17:13.930
All right. We'll head to the west gate, then.

17:15.900 --> 17:18.290
Rina, thanks.

17:20.730 --> 17:24.470
I only made it this far thanks to you.

17:24.470 --> 17:27.590
No, don't act like we're saying goodbye!

17:27.810 --> 17:32.100
I'll help you as much as I can until 
we get in town. No, even after that!

17:32.530 --> 17:37.860
Yes, I do need someone to help me. But...

17:38.920 --> 17:44.480
I'm a monster. If you help me get 
inside, you'll be a criminal.

17:45.660 --> 17:50.150
You might lose your adventurer's license.

17:51.730 --> 17:54.650
I don't want to cause trouble for you.

17:56.540 --> 17:57.630
Um...

17:58.160 --> 18:01.470
If I hadn't met you, I'd be dead.

18:02.550 --> 18:08.580
So at least once, I think it's okay 
for me to risk my life for you!

18:08.950 --> 18:11.330
Now let's go, Rentt!

18:14.150 --> 18:16.150
We're about to close the gate!

18:16.440 --> 18:17.470
Next!

18:19.680 --> 18:21.220
A man and a woman?

18:21.220 --> 18:22.740
Show us your IDs.

18:24.620 --> 18:26.450
Adventurers?

18:26.450 --> 18:30.730
Rentt Faina the bronze-class, and 
Rina Rupaage the iron-class, right?

18:30.730 --> 18:31.670
Fine.

18:35.080 --> 18:37.800
You've got quite an unusual appearance.

18:38.560 --> 18:40.670
Do I?

18:40.670 --> 18:43.030
Have you seen him before?

18:43.420 --> 18:45.420
You ever been to Maalt?

18:47.390 --> 18:49.500
Let us see your face!

18:50.670 --> 18:55.350
I'm sorry... His mask is cursed, 
and he can't take it off!

18:55.350 --> 18:56.390
Cursed?

18:56.390 --> 18:58.070
Is that why he talks weird?

18:58.540 --> 19:03.030
That's because he was horribly 
injured after fighting a monster..

19:07.490 --> 19:11.910
He bought the mask to hide the 
scars, and it was cursed.

19:11.910 --> 19:14.150
Now he can't take it off.

19:14.150 --> 19:15.800
That's awful luck.

19:16.130 --> 19:18.910
Try to pull it off yourself, please.

19:19.610 --> 19:21.660
It's safe to touch!

19:21.660 --> 19:23.130
I've touched it too.

19:25.030 --> 19:26.060
Okay!

19:28.240 --> 19:31.740
It really won't come off!

19:30.510 --> 19:35.610
We need to donate a lot to the 
church to have a cleric remove it.

19:35.970 --> 19:38.250
And we're having trouble 
saving up the money...

19:38.250 --> 19:39.700
That's rough.

19:41.890 --> 19:44.280
Fine! You may pass!

19:47.240 --> 19:48.670
Okay, next!

19:49.240 --> 19:51.280
We did it, Rentt!

19:51.280 --> 19:54.670
It's all... thanks to you.

19:54.920 --> 19:56.380
Thank you.

19:56.830 --> 19:59.500
I'm just repaying the debt I owe you!

20:03.910 --> 20:05.380
What's the plan now?

20:07.110 --> 20:09.370
Huh? Rentt?

20:09.710 --> 20:12.470
Rentt? Rentt?

20:12.830 --> 20:16.350
Rentt? Where did you go?

20:15.850 --> 20:17.850
<i>She really is a good kid.</i>

20:18.340 --> 20:21.340
<i>Her equipment's cheap, but 
it's been well-maintained.</i>

20:21.340 --> 20:24.090
<i>She has a knack for swinging that 
sword, and she's pretty smart.</i>

20:24.090 --> 20:25.090
<i>Brave, too.</i>

20:25.610 --> 20:29.620
<i>She'll make a fine adventurer. I can tell.</i>

20:30.080 --> 20:35.040
<i>All the people I know with talent like 
that left me behind really fast...</i>

20:35.730 --> 20:41.640
<i>I'm sorry. When I look a little 
more human, I'll come apologize.</i>

20:45.410 --> 20:49.670
<i>Now, it's hard to manipulate 
a kind girl like Rina...</i>

20:49.670 --> 20:51.830
<i>but I do need a human cooperator.</i>

20:52.530 --> 20:56.930
<i>Somebody who's got a bit of a past, 
and who can be trusted to keep secrets.</i>

21:21.630 --> 21:23.420
Lorraine...

21:24.910 --> 21:27.420
Lorraine... wake up.

21:27.930 --> 21:29.750
I said wake up!

21:30.710 --> 21:33.440
Let me sleep just a little more...

21:34.180 --> 21:38.400
I'll drop a book on your head.

21:39.100 --> 21:43.240
Please don't do that...

21:47.990 --> 21:50.350
Rentt, you...?!

21:51.710 --> 21:55.240
Oh, it's just a mask. 
Don't scare me like that.

22:01.330 --> 22:04.140
Rentt... What happened?

23:35.680 --> 23:40.010
The Undead Infiltrates the Town
